The dashboard image is built from Supabase Studio, part of the upstream repository
https://github.com/supabase/supabase, at the commit named in studio/PIN. Supabase Studio is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the upstream repository's LICENSE file).

This directory holds only this project's changes to it: a list of upstream files removed
before the build (delete.txt), a series of patches (patches/), tables and gates the build
checks, and the scripts that build the image. The patches are offered under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, this repository's licence. No upstream file is held here beyond the
context lines a patch needs.

Every built image carries upstream's LICENSE, a NOTICE.supapace naming the upstream commit
and every file the build modified, removed or added, the licence notices of the third-party
packages the server is built from (THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES), and a one-line change notice in
every modified source file whose format admits a comment.
